l|Matsudaira Nobunori|WD=Q930282|1=Matsudaira Nobunori}}; {{ill|Matsudaira Tadakazu|WD=Q6788070|1=Matsudaira Tadakazu}}; {{ill|Matsudaira Takeakira|WD=Q6997690|1=Matsudaira Takeakira}}; {{ill|Matsudaira Yoriyuki|WD=Q6638511|1=Matsudaira Yoriyuki}}; {{ill|Mochimasa Ikeda|WD=Q6997367|1=Mochimasa Ikeda}}; {{ill|Tokugawa Akitake|WD=Q3530485|1=Tokugawa Akitake}}; {{ill|Tokugawa Sadako|WD=Q6997477|1=Tokugawa Sadako}}; {{ill|Tokugawa Yoshiatsu|WD=Q6998470|1=Tokugawa Yoshiatsu}}; {{ill|Tsuchiya Shigenao|WD=Q6997808|1=Tsuchiya Shigenao}}; {{ill|Yoshinori Ikeda|WD=Q6997412|1=Yoshinori Ikeda}}|family={{ill|Hitotsubashi House|WD=Q10863984|1=Hitotsubashi House}}; {{ill|Mito branch|WD=Q842246|1=Mito Tokugawa family}}; {{ill|Tokugawa Yoshinobu family|WD=Q7480630|1=Tokugawa Yoshinobu family}}; {{ill|Tokugawa clan|WD=Q1412769|1=Tokugawa clan}}; {{ill|Tokugawa family|WD=Q11071640|1=Tokugawa family}}|awards={{ill|Order of the Rising Sun with Paulownia Flowers, 1st class|WD=Q11288429|1=Order of the Rising Sun with Paulownia Flowers, 1st class}}; {{ill|Order of the Rising Sun, 1st class|WD=Q10901470|1=Order of the Rising Sun, 1st class}}|native_name=徳川慶喜|given_name={{ill|Yoshinobu|WD=Q8056196|1=Yoshinobu}}|resting_place={{ill|Yanaka Cemetery|WD=Q864387|1=Yanaka Cemetery}}}}
